---
title: Implementation · gated attempts, fenced code work
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant gate as Implementation Gate
  participant cp as Implementation controller
  box Vercel Sandbox · fenced by the lease
    participant codex as Codex · GPT-6.1 Sol
    participant repo as Repository checkout
  end
  participant pv as Preview Version

  gate->>cp: approved_live<br/>frozen scope + current budgets
  Note over gate,cp: Dispatch authority covers approved live work only.
  cp->>cp: atomic commit
  Note over cp: Attempt + dispatch intent.<br/>One attempt per gate decision, up to the limit.
  cp->>repo: claim the prepared workspace under the lease
  loop Each cycle, within scope + execution limits
    cp->>codex: codex exec · frozen scope + cited files
    codex->>repo: inspect · scoped search<br/>exact reads of current files
    codex->>repo: implement · bounded edit
    codex-->>cp: checkpoint result + artifacts<br/>collected under the lease
    cp->>repo: test · required checks on baseline<br/>+ candidate, then the scope check
    opt New failure or mechanical violation
      cp-->>codex: correction cycle
    end
  end
  cp->>pv: publish if ready
  Note over pv: Immutable checked build.<br/>Separate candidate runtime.
